  "title": "Shrimp and Mushroom Linguini with Creamy Cheese Herb Sauce",
  "description": "Cooked shrimp and sliced fresh mushrooms are bathed in sauteed garlic, cream cheese, fresh parsley and a dash of basil. Toss with hot linguini and serve as an elegant appetizer or main dish.",
  "authors": [
